    cof:title "23WD(1) Forensic procedure may be carried out with informed" ;
    values:kind "subsection" ;
    values:originalText "(1) A person is authorised to carry out a forensic procedure on a suspect with the informed consent of the suspect. The person is authorised to carry out the procedure in accordance with Division 6 and not otherwise." ;
    cof:pageNumber "33"^^xsd:integer .

