concept:crimes-act-1914-sec-23wl-ss-2 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "23WL(2) Recording of giving of information and suspect’s responses"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-23wl-ss-2 ;
    values:originalText "(2) If tape recording the giving of the information and the suspect’s responses (if any) is not practicable, the constable must ensure that a written record of the giving of the information and the suspect’s responses (if any) is made, and that a copy of the record is made available to the suspect. Note 1: Division 9 contains provisions about making copies of material (including copies of tapes) available to the suspect. Note 2: If a foreign law enforcement agency requests that a forensic procedure be carried out on a suspect, a copy of the tape recording or the written record may also be provided to the foreign law enforcement agency: see subsection 23YQD(2). 23WLA  Time for carrying out forensic procedure—suspect not in custody" ;
    skos:definition "(2) If tape recording the giving of the information and the suspect’s responses (if any) is not practicable, the constable must ensure that a written record of the giving of the information and the suspect’s responses (if any) is made, and that a copy of the record is made available to the suspect. Note 1: Division 9 contains provisions about making copies of material (including copies of tapes) available to the suspect. Note 2: If a foreign law enforcement agency requests that a forensic procedure be carried out on a suspect, a copy of the tape recording or the written record may also be provided to the foreign law enforcement agency: see subsection 23YQD(2). 23WLA  Time for carrying out forensic procedure—suspect not in custody"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "1ab2a0c62b115e01336000372f6cd95f3d48edac232a8371673232b4ff29024e" ;
    values:partOf concept:crimes-act-1914-sec-23wl ;
    cof:pageNumber "42"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "Exemptions from time limits for forensic procedures Constable must ensure written record of information and suspect's responses is made available to the suspect." ;
    dc:description "written record of information and suspect's responses" ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
    cml:schemaVersion "2" ;
    cml:proposedBy <https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml> ;
