concept:crimes-act-1914-sec-23xk a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "23XK Forensic procedures not to be carried out in cruel, inhuman"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-23xk ;
    values:originalText "or degrading manner  For the purpose of this Part, the carrying out of a forensic procedure is not of itself taken to be cruel, inhuman or degrading. However, nothing in this Part authorises the carrying out of a forensic procedure in a cruel, inhuman or degrading manner." ;
    skos:definition "or degrading manner  For the purpose of this Part, the carrying out of a forensic procedure is not of itself taken to be cruel, inhuman or degrading. However, nothing in this Part authorises the carrying out of a forensic procedure in a cruel, inhuman or degrading manner."@en ;
