concept:crimes-act-1914-sec-23xn-ss-3 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "23XN(3) Certain forensic procedures generally to be carried out by"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-23xn-ss-3 ;
    values:originalText "(3) If practicable, a person asked under section 23XO to help carry out a forensic procedure covered by subsection (1) or (2):  (a) is to be:  (i) if the suspect is an adult—a person of the same sex as the suspect; or  (ii) if the suspect is a child—a person of the sex chosen by the suspect or, if the suspect does not wish to make such a choice, by a person of the same sex as the suspect; and  (b) is to be a person who is not inappropriate to help carry out the forensic procedure." ;
    skos:definition "(3) If practicable, a person asked under section 23XO to help carry out a forensic procedure covered by subsection (1) or (2):  (a) is to be:  (i) if the suspect is an adult—a person of the same sex as the suspect; or  (ii) if the suspect is a child—a person of the sex chosen by the suspect or, if the suspect does not wish to make such a choice, by a person of the same sex as the suspect; and  (b) is to be a person who is not inappropriate to help carry out the forensic procedure."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "e34223f7868c9015437186894c50f71015230eb3510666f3a5c404414ea3d284" ;
    values:partOf concept:crimes-act-1914-sec-23xn ;
    cof:pageNumber "68"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "Person asked under section 23XO to help carry out forensic procedure must be of same sex as suspect or chosen by suspect if child." ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
    cml:schemaVersion "2" ;
