doc:sec-23xn-ss-3 a cof:Section ;
    cof:title "23XN(3) Certain forensic procedures generally to be carried out by" ;
    values:kind "subsection" ;
    values:originalText "(3) If practicable, a person asked under section 23XO to help carry out a forensic procedure covered by subsection (1) or (2):  (a) is to be:  (i) if the suspect is an adult—a person of the same sex as the suspect; or  (ii) if the suspect is a child—a person of the sex chosen by the suspect or, if the suspect does not wish to make such a choice, by a person of the same sex as the suspect; and  (b) is to be a person who is not inappropriate to help carry out the forensic procedure." ;
    cof:pageNumber "68"^^xsd:integer .

concept:crimes-act-1914-sec-23xo a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "23XO Person may get help to carry out forensic procedures"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-23xo ;
    values:originalText "(1) A person who is authorised to carry out a forensic procedure under the table in section 23XM is authorised to ask another person to help him or her to carry out the procedure, and the other person is authorised to give that help.  (2) A person who is asked to help carry out a forensic procedure need not be a person mentioned in the table in section 23XM.  (3) A person who is asked to help carry out a forensic procedure may use reasonable force to enable the forensic procedure to be carried out." ;
    skos:definition "(1) A person who is authorised to carry out a forensic procedure under the table in section 23XM is authorised to ask another person to help him or her to carry out the procedure, and the other person is authorised to give that help.  (2) A person who is asked to help carry out a forensic procedure need not be a person mentioned in the table in section 23XM.  (3) A person who is asked to help carry out a forensic procedure may use reasonable force to enable the forensic procedure to be carried out."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "13b74abd122dea7d429e12c1839cf6561090e9b87f8cca5d4c62d26cd5f04ae9" ;
    cof:pageNumber "69"^^xsd:integer ;
    cml:hasPart concept:crimes-act-1914-sec-23xo-ss-1 ;
