    values:originalText "(1) A suspect is entitled to request a medical practitioner or dentist (the expert) of his or her choice as shown in the table in section 23XM to be present while a forensic procedure (other than a non-intimate forensic procedure) is carried out. Note: Section 23YE provides that the request may be made by the suspect’s legal representative or interview friend." ;
    cof:pageNumber "70"^^xsd:integer .

