doc:sec-23yf-ss-3 a cof:Section ;
    cof:title "23YF(3) Obligation of investigating constables relating to tape" ;
    values:kind "subsection" ;
    values:originalText "(3) If section 23YD requires forensic material taken from a suspect, offender or volunteer by a forensic procedure to be destroyed, the investigating constable must ensure that any video recording of the carrying out of the forensic procedure is also destroyed." ;
