    cof:title "23YH No charge to be made for giving material etc. to suspects," ;
    values:kind "section" ;
    values:originalText "offenders and volunteers  If a provision of this Part requires material of any kind to be given to a suspect, offender or volunteer, or an opportunity to view a video recording to be given to a suspect, offender or volunteer, the material or the opportunity to view the video must be given without charge.   Forensic procedures  Part ID General provisions relating to operation of this Part  Division 9  Section 23YI  Crimes Act 1914  Compilation date: 04/06/2026" ;
    cof:pageNumber "118"^^xsd:integer .

concept:crimes-act-1914-sec-23yi a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "23YI Proof of belief or suspicion"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-23yi ;
    values:originalText "In any proceedings, the burden lies on the prosecution to prove on the balance of probabilities that a constable had a belief on reasonable grounds, or suspected on reasonable grounds, as to a matter referred to in this Part." ;
    skos:definition "In any proceedings, the burden lies on the prosecution to prove on the balance of probabilities that a constable had a belief on reasonable grounds, or suspected on reasonable grounds, as to a matter referred to in this Part."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "9a2dac302da652128d0a88e76d44c73072f55f8df1d5dd262c431cb188de66d1" ;
    cof:pageNumber "119"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "Prosecution must prove belief or suspicion on reasonable grounds." ;
    dc:description "Evidence" ;
