concept:crimes-act-1914-sec-23yj a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "23YJ Proof of impracticability"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-23yj ;
    values:originalText "In any proceedings, the burden lies on the prosecution to prove on the balance of probabilities that it was not practicable to do something required by this Part to be done if practicable. 23YJA  Proof that time should be disregarded  In any proceedings, the burden lies on the prosecution to prove on the balance of probabilities that any particular time was covered by a provision of subsection 23WLA(2), 23XGB(2) or 23XGD(2)." ;
    skos:definition "In any proceedings, the burden lies on the prosecution to prove on the balance of probabilities that it was not practicable to do something required by this Part to be done if practicable. 23YJA  Proof that time should be disregarded  In any proceedings, the burden lies on the prosecution to prove on the balance of probabilities that any particular time was covered by a provision of subsection 23WLA(2), 23XGB(2) or 23XGD(2)."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "43de45d75c6964c4dbb6688986481d20d47ce79233cd24fd5de01516ae46e9f4" ;
    cof:pageNumber "119"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "Prosecution must prove impracticability on balance of probabilities." ;
    dc:description "Evidence of impracticability" ;
