doc:sec-23za a cof:Section ;
    cof:title "23ZA Application" ;
    values:kind "section" ;
    values:originalText "This Part applies to a thing (the forfeitable thing) that is:  (a) child abuse material; or  (c) any of the following that contains child abuse material:  (i) a computer;  (ii) a data storage device;  (iii) another piece of electronic equipment." ;
