concept:crimes-act-1914-sec-23zb-ss-4 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "23ZB(4) Forfeiture of material by operation of law"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-23zb-ss-4 ;
    values:originalText "(4) If the constable gives the forfeiture notice to a person described in subsection (2), the constable may also give a copy of the notice to anyone whom the constable reasonably believes will be directly or indirectly affected by the proposed forfeiture of the forfeitable thing. Effect of giving forfeiture notice" ;
    skos:definition "(4) If the constable gives the forfeiture notice to a person described in subsection (2), the constable may also give a copy of the notice to anyone whom the constable reasonably believes will be directly or indirectly affected by the proposed forfeiture of the forfeitable thing. Effect of giving forfeiture notice"@en ;
