concept:crimes-act-1914-sec-23zd-ss-3 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "23ZD(3) Forfeiture of material by court order on application"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-23zd-ss-3 ;
    values:originalText "(3) At any time after the application is made to the court, it may make any interim orders it considers appropriate (such as orders relating to the delivery or retention of things pending the court’s decision   Forfeiture of child abuse material  Part IE Forfeiture by court order on application  Division 3  Section 23ZD  Crimes Act 1914  Compilation date: 04/06/2026  on the application, and orders relating to the making and provision of copies of things). Circumstances that do not prevent court ordering forfeiture" ;
    skos:definition "(3) At any time after the application is made to the court, it may make any interim orders it considers appropriate (such as orders relating to the delivery or retention of things pending the court’s decision   Forfeiture of child abuse material  Part IE Forfeiture by court order on application  Division 3  Section 23ZD  Crimes Act 1914  Compilation date: 04/06/2026  on the application, and orders relating to the making and provision of copies of things). Circumstances that do not prevent court ordering forfeiture"@en ;
