doc:sec-23zd-ss-3 a cof:Section ;
    cof:title "23ZD(3) Forfeiture of material by court order on application" ;
    values:kind "subsection" ;
    values:originalText "(3) At any time after the application is made to the court, it may make any interim orders it considers appropriate (such as orders relating to the delivery or retention of things pending the court’s decision   Forfeiture of child abuse material  Part IE Forfeiture by court order on application  Division 3  Section 23ZD  Crimes Act 1914  Compilation date: 04/06/2026  on the application, and orders relating to the making and provision of copies of things). Circumstances that do not prevent court ordering forfeiture" ;
    cof:pageNumber "144"^^xsd:integer .

concept:crimes-act-1914-sec-23zd-ss-4 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "23ZD(4) Forfeiture of material by court order on application"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-23zd-ss-4 ;
    values:originalText "(4) An order under subsection (1):  (a) may be made even if a person entitled to be given notice of the application fails to appear at the hearing of the application; and  (b) need not be based on a finding as to the commission of a particular Commonwealth child sex offence; and  (c) can be based on a finding that some such offence was committed; and  (d) need not be based on a finding that a particular person committed a Commonwealth child sex offence. Court may order compensation for forfeiture" ;
    skos:definition "(4) An order under subsection (1):  (a) may be made even if a person entitled to be given notice of the application fails to appear at the hearing of the application; and  (b) need not be based on a finding as to the commission of a particular Commonwealth child sex offence; and  (c) can be based on a finding that some such offence was committed; and  (d) need not be based on a finding that a particular person committed a Commonwealth child sex offence. Court may order compensation for forfeiture"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "6209fe9c013db89d249778dc70c552cc00c09c6a478073f2910988cc66c666de" ;
    values:partOf concept:crimes-act-1914-sec-23zd ;
    cof:pageNumber "144"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "Court may order forfeiture of material without notice or finding of specific offence." ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
