concept:crimes-act-1914-sec-23ze-ss-1 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "23ZE(1) Effect of forfeiture under this Part"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-23ze-ss-1 ;
    values:originalText "(1) This section applies to a person if:  (a) a thing that is a computer, data storage device or other electronic equipment is forfeited under this Part; and  (b) the person owned, had a right to possess or had other property in the thing immediately before the forfeiture." ;
