concept:crimes-act-1914-sec-23zg a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "23ZG Delegation by head of police force"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-23zg ;
    values:originalText "The head of a police force (including the Commissioner) may, by writing, delegate to a constable who is a member of the force all or any of the head’s powers, functions and duties under this Part.   Protection of public and other services  Part IIA  Section 30J  Crimes Act 1914  Compilation date: 04/06/2026" ;
    skos:definition "The head of a police force (including the Commissioner) may, by writing, delegate to a constable who is a member of the force all or any of the head’s powers, functions and duties under this Part.   Protection of public and other services  Part IIA  Section 30J  Crimes Act 1914  Compilation date: 04/06/2026"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "4058516e79f9507fabd8566d5110d4e8bd5a5d909510b355398252e4b9be1ba9" ;
