concept:crimes-act-1914-sec-30j-ss-3 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "30J(3) Industrial disturbances, lock-outs and strikes"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-30j-ss-3 ;
    values:originalText "(3) For the purposes of this section: employee includes any person whose usual occupation is as an employee. employer includes any person whose usual occupation is as an employer. lock-out includes the closing of a place or part of a place of employment, if the closing is unreasonable, and the total or partial refusal of employers, acting in combination, to give work, if the refusal is unreasonable, or the total or partial suspension of work by an employer, if the suspension is unreasonable, with a view to" ;
    skos:definition "(3) For the purposes of this section: employee includes any person whose usual occupation is as an employee. employer includes any person whose usual occupation is as an employer. lock-out includes the closing of a place or part of a place of employment, if the closing is unreasonable, and the total or partial refusal of employers, acting in combination, to give work, if the refusal is unreasonable, or the total or partial suspension of work by an employer, if the suspension is unreasonable, with a view to"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "f287deaf2020ee05fbbee3b5d7a08d72be32360cb29a5aa89e3e84d283707fbe" ;
