    skos:prefLabel "45(2) Inserting advertisements without authority of court"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-45-ss-2 ;
    values:originalText "(2) Absolute liability applies to the paragraph (1)(c) element of the offence. Note: For absolute liability, see section 6.2 of the Criminal Code.   Offences relating to the administration of justice  Part III Escape from criminal detention  Division 5  Section 45A  Crimes Act 1914  Compilation date: 04/06/2026" ;
