doc:sec-45a a cof:Section ;
    cof:title "45A Criminal detention definitions" ;
    values:kind "section" ;
    values:originalText "In this Act: criminal detention: a person is in criminal detention if the person:  (a) is arrested in respect of an offence; or  (b) is in custody in respect of an offence; or  (c) is detained because:  (i) the person is unfit to be tried in respect of an offence; or  (ii) the person has been acquitted of an offence because of mental illness at the time of the offence; or  (iii) the person has been convicted of an offence and a court has ordered that the person be detained for the purposes of receiving treatment for a mental illness that contributed to the commission of the offence. Example: Paragraph (c) includes detention under: (a) Division 6 of Part IB (unfitness to be tried); or (b) Division 7 of Part IB or section 20BS (mental illness). federal criminal detention means criminal detention in respect of an offence against a law of:  (a) the Commonwealth; or  (b) a Territory (other than the Australian Capital Territory)." ;
    cof:pageNumber "165"^^xsd:integer .

concept:crimes-act-1914-sec-46 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "46 Aiding prisoner to escape"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-46 ;
    values:originalText "(1) A person (the first person) commits an offence if:  (a) another person (the prisoner) is in criminal detention; and  (b) the first person aids the prisoner:  (i) to escape from that detention; or  (ii) to attempt to escape from that detention; and  (c) the prisoner escapes, or attempts to escape, from that detention; and" ;
    skos:definition "(1) A person (the first person) commits an offence if:  (a) another person (the prisoner) is in criminal detention; and  (b) the first person aids the prisoner:  (i) to escape from that detention; or  (ii) to attempt to escape from that detention; and  (c) the prisoner escapes, or attempts to escape, from that detention; and"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "0fea36373c738848c92c337fce6800602700eda26cef50fdccc53b4f7efad582" ;
    cof:pageNumber "165"^^xsd:integer ;
