concept:crimes-act-1914-sec-47b a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "47B Person unlawfully at large"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-47b ;
    values:originalText "(1) A person commits an offence if:  (a) the person was in criminal detention in a prison, lock-up or other place of criminal detention; and  (b) the detention was lawful federal criminal detention; and  (c) in accordance with a permission given under a law of a State or Territory (other than the Australian Capital Territory), the person leaves the prison, lock-up or other place; and" ;
    skos:definition "(1) A person commits an offence if:  (a) the person was in criminal detention in a prison, lock-up or other place of criminal detention; and  (b) the detention was lawful federal criminal detention; and  (c) in accordance with a permission given under a law of a State or Territory (other than the Australian Capital Territory), the person leaves the prison, lock-up or other place; and"@en ;
