concept:crimes-act-1914-sec-53-ss-3 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "53(3) Operating a pirate-controlled ship or aircraft"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-53-ss-3 ;
    values:originalText "(3) The Supreme Court of a State or Territory may:  (a) on the application by the custodian of, or a person with an interest in, a ship, aircraft or thing seized under this section, order that the ship, aircraft or thing be returned to its lawful owner; or  (b) on its own motion, or on application:  (i) if:  (A) a person has been convicted of an offence against this Part; and  (B) the ship, aircraft or thing was used in, or was otherwise involved in the commission of, the offence;  order that the ship, aircraft or thing be forfeited to the Commonwealth; or  (ii) make any order relating to the seizure, detention or disposal of the ship, aircraft or thing." ;
    skos:definition "(3) The Supreme Court of a State or Territory may:  (a) on the application by the custodian of, or a person with an interest in, a ship, aircraft or thing seized under this section, order that the ship, aircraft or thing be returned to its lawful owner; or  (b) on its own motion, or on application:  (i) if:  (A) a person has been convicted of an offence against this Part; and  (B) the ship, aircraft or thing was used in, or was otherwise involved in the commission of, the offence;  order that the ship, aircraft or thing be forfeited to the Commonwealth; or  (ii) make any order relating to the seizure, detention or disposal of the ship, aircraft or thing."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "8108c9c2f59676d437cf4f7dcd8b4dc117a74ee9518967bff0212740424f04c7" ;
    values:partOf concept:crimes-act-1914-sec-53 ;
    cof:pageNumber "172"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "Prohibition on operating a pirate-controlled ship or aircraft" ;
