concept:crimes-act-1914-sec-85f-ss-5a a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "85F(5A) Interpretation—expressions used in Australian Postal"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-85f-ss-5a ;
    values:originalText "(5A) Subsections (3), (4) and (5) do not apply if the person has a reasonable excuse. Note: A defendant bears an evidential burden in relation to the matter in subsection (5A) (see subsection 13.3(3) of the Criminal Code)." ;
