concept:crimes-act-1914-sec-85w-ss-2 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "85W(2) Causing controlled drugs or controlled plants to be carried by"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-85w-ss-2 ;
    values:originalText "(2) Where an act constitutes an offence against a law of a State or Territory, the validity of the law is not affected merely because the act also constitutes an offence against subsection (1). Exceptions—supply of pharmaceutical products etc. to remote locations" ;
    skos:definition "(2) Where an act constitutes an offence against a law of a State or Territory, the validity of the law is not affected merely because the act also constitutes an offence against subsection (1). Exceptions—supply of pharmaceutical products etc. to remote locations"@en ;
