concept:crimes-act-1914-sec-85z a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "85Z Articles carried by post to be taken to be Australia Post’s"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-85z ;
    values:originalText "property  For the purpose of any prosecution for an offence in relation to an article carried by post or under the control of Australia Post, the article shall be taken to be the property of Australia Post. 85ZA  Postage stamps to be valuable securities etc.  A postage stamp, and any document issued by Australia Post in relation to the carriage by post of money or a direction to pay an amount of money, shall be taken to be a valuable security for the purposes of any law relating to larceny." ;
    skos:definition "property  For the purpose of any prosecution for an offence in relation to an article carried by post or under the control of Australia Post, the article shall be taken to be the property of Australia Post. 85ZA  Postage stamps to be valuable securities etc.  A postage stamp, and any document issued by Australia Post in relation to the carriage by post of money or a direction to pay an amount of money, shall be taken to be a valuable security for the purposes of any law relating to larceny."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "6a3437f3c3e98a507661f23331e41f09b372917c1385d09d4be169008c5f1ff8" ;
    cof:pageNumber "183"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "Article carried by post is taken to be Australia Post's property for prosecution purposes." ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
    cml:schemaVersion "2" ;
    cml:proposedBy <https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml> ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom <crimes-act-1914.pdf> ;
    dc:source "crimes-act-1914.pdf, p.183" ;
