    values:originalText "This Part binds the Crown in right of the Commonwealth, of each of the States, of the Australian Capital Territory and of the Northern Territory.   Pardons, quashed convictions and spent convictions  Part VIIC Pardons for persons wrongly convicted, and quashed convictions  Division 2  Section 85ZR  Crimes Act 1914  Compilation date: 04/06/2026" ;
