concept:crimes-act-1914-sec-85zr-ss-1 cml:asserts concept:crimes-act-1914-sec-85zr-ss-1-logic-argumentation-5 .
concept:crimes-act-1914-sec-85zr-ss-1-logic-argumentation-5 a cml:LogicApplication ;
