concept:crimes-act-1914-sec-85zy a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "85ZY Convictions of further State or foreign offences"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-85zy ;
    values:originalText "Subject to subsection 85ZV(3), where:   Pardons, quashed convictions and spent convictions  Part VIIC Convictions of further offences  Division 4  Section 85ZY  Crimes Act 1914  Compilation date: 04/06/2026  (a) Division 3 applies to a person in relation to an offence of which the person was convicted, or would so apply to the person if the waiting period for the offence had ended; and  (b) before or after the end of the waiting period for the offence, the person is convicted (whether summarily or on indictment) by a court of a State (not being a court exercising federal jurisdiction) or a court of a foreign country, of another offence, being an offence committed during that waiting period; Division 3 ceases to apply or does not apply to the person, as the case requires, in relation to the earlier offence until the waiting period for the later offence has ended." ;
    skos:definition "Subject to subsection 85ZV(3), where:   Pardons, quashed convictions and spent convictions  Part VIIC Convictions of further offences  Division 4  Section 85ZY  Crimes Act 1914  Compilation date: 04/06/2026  (a) Division 3 applies to a person in relation to an offence of which the person was convicted, or would so apply to the person if the waiting period for the offence had ended; and  (b) before or after the end of the waiting period for the offence, the person is convicted (whether summarily or on indictment) by a court of a State (not being a court exercising federal jurisdiction) or a court of a foreign country, of another offence, being an offence committed during that waiting period; Division 3 ceases to apply or does not apply to the person, as the case requires, in relation to the earlier offence until the waiting period for the later offence has ended."@en ;
