concept:crimes-act-1914-sec-85zz-ss-2 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "85ZZ(2) Information Commissioner’s functions"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-85zz-ss-2 ;
    values:originalText "(2) If a complaint is about an act or practice of another Commonwealth authority or State authority, or a member or officer of such an authority, being an authority that is within the responsibility of a Commonwealth or State Minister but not within the responsibility of a Commonwealth Department or a State Department, the Minister is the respondent to the complaint." ;
    skos:definition "(2) If a complaint is about an act or practice of another Commonwealth authority or State authority, or a member or officer of such an authority, being an authority that is within the responsibility of a Commonwealth or State Minister but not within the responsibility of a Commonwealth Department or a State Department, the Minister is the respondent to the complaint."@en ;
