concept:crimes-act-1914-sec-86c a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "86C Target entity may collect sensitive information for integrity"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-86c ;
    values:originalText "purpose  A target entity may collect for an integrity purpose sensitive information that:  (a) if the target entity is a Privacy Act agency—is reasonably necessary for, or directly related to, one or more of the entity’s functions or activities; or  (b) if the target entity is a wholly-owned Commonwealth company—is reasonably necessary for one or more of the entity’s functions or activities. Note: Subclause 3.3 of Australian Privacy Principle 3 limits the circumstances in which an APP entity may collect sensitive information. This section lets a target entity collect sensitive" ;
    skos:definition "purpose  A target entity may collect for an integrity purpose sensitive information that:  (a) if the target entity is a Privacy Act agency—is reasonably necessary for, or directly related to, one or more of the entity’s functions or activities; or  (b) if the target entity is a wholly-owned Commonwealth company—is reasonably necessary for one or more of the entity’s functions or activities. Note: Subclause 3.3 of Australian Privacy Principle 3 limits the circumstances in which an APP entity may collect sensitive information. This section lets a target entity collect sensitive"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "457745d1dcb6cdedd20474f35253ac01173b281648b838d3c03dd7d96111a256" ;
    cof:pageNumber "221"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "Target entity may collect sensitive information for integrity purposes." ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
    cml:schemaVersion "2" ;
    cml:proposedBy <https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml> ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom <crimes-act-1914.pdf> ;
    dc:source "crimes-act-1914.pdf, p.221" ;
